Z||000002||stsmithgt||12-05-2000||10:26 AM||||I have a similar problem.  Sometimes the pedal sticks and then pushing harder, it pops loose, but doesn't move smoothly when pushing it down.  It's real jerky and makes it irritating going through traffic.  If it's not the cable, there is some linkage under the dash I would look at.  I haven't looked at mine yet.  I think it's really worn out and is sticking even with lube on it.  I ment to look in the book last night, but I worked late and getting under the dash was out the the question last night, ouch.  Good luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
